<title>USA: Alumax unit raises sheet prices.</title>
<headline>Alumax unit raises sheet prices.</headline>
<dateline>NORCROSS, Ga. 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alumax Inc's Alumax Mill Products Inc Tuesday said it is raising common alloy sheet transaction prices by $0.03 per pound from previous levels.</p>
<p>The increase applies to OEM (original equipment manufacturer) and distributor production orders as well as distributor depot sales.</p>
<p>The new prices apply to orders as of December 23, 1996, and shipments on or after December 30, 1996, regardless of order entry date.</p>
</text>
